Portions of Transom are adapted from Omarchy
(https://github.com/omacom/omarchy): the minimize script (`minimize`, a copy
of Omarchy's omarchy-hyprland-window-minimize without its floating-only
check), the dock's entry-id matching (`TasksModel.js`, `claimingEntryId`)
and drag-reorder math (`Reorder.js`), the bar API Omarchy's widgets expect
(`ui/OmarchyBarApi.qml`, after PluginBarApi), the popup outside-click grab
(`ui/AnchoredPopup.qml`, after PopupCard), and the list of tray icons
Omarchy's widgets stand in for (`TrayModel.js`). Those portions keep
